 ('43108','Counts borrowing proceeds as tax revenue rather than financing of the revenue shortfall.'),
 ('43116','Subtracts intragovernmental holdings from debt held by the public instead of adding them to obtain gross debt.'),
 ('43125','Subtracts debt from GDP and labels the difference a percentage instead of dividing debt by GDP.'),
 ('43138','Reports the complement of the debt-to-GDP share rather than debt divided by GDP.'),
 ('43142 43148','Converts the stated interest percentage to a decimal ten times too large when multiplying by the debt stock.'),
 ('43143','Uses total outlays as a percentage label rather than dividing interest outlays by total outlays.'),
