 ('43256 43268 43274 43286 PMOE-FX-E-003','Uses a rate at a different location instead of reading the specified equilibrium intersection.'),
 ('PM2A-DIS-MB-015','Reports the additional inflation-point target without multiplying by the output cost per inflation point.'),
 ('PM2A-SAC-FB-022','Uses the completed first-stage sacrifice ratio for the remaining stage instead of its remaining loss and target.'),
 ('PMOE-NCO-B2-001 PMOE-TX-M-004','Reverses resident purchases of foreign assets minus foreign purchases of domestic assets.'),
 ('PMOE-NCO-H-004 PMOE-TX-LB-001','Rearranges NCO = resident foreign-asset purchases minus foreign domestic-asset purchases with the wrong sign.'),
 ('PMOE-NCO-L-001','Keeps only the upper foreign-purchase-growth threshold and omits the lower threshold required for a net inflow.'),
 ('PMOE-NCO-M-001','Reports the gross inward asset flow instead of subtracting it from the gross outward flow.'),
 ('PMOE-NER-B1-002 PMOE-NER-M-001','Does not multiply the dollar amount by the stated yen-per-dollar quotation.'),
