 ('PMOE-NER-B2-002','Treats the foreign-currency quantity alone as the reciprocal rate instead of dividing domestic units by foreign units.'),
 ('PMOE-NER-B3-003','Assumes reciprocal exchange-rate percentage changes have equal absolute magnitudes.'),
 ('PMOE-NER-E-001','Inverts the supplied euros-per-dollar quote even though the question already asks for euros per dollar.'),
